id: pm-gh1561
title: "GH-1561: normalize numeric template-save priority and publish supported options"
description: "Reported on2026.10.23: public runTemplatesSave accepts numeric priority0 via Record<string, unknown> but silently omits it, so a later templated item receives priority2. The string0 control and direct numeric create work. Investigate typed save options and pre-write normalization/refusal."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 2
